Z||000006||kslish||08-15-2001||11:11 PM||||Won't bore everyone with my story, but the high tech sector ain't what it used to be anymore.  Been there, done that....<P>I do feel fortunate for being severenced out of my tech job due to a merger (got some cash and health insurance for a year) rather than just being outright laid off.  <P>I hope there are unemployment compensation plans and/or laws up there in Canada as good as the ones in the USA (or at least here in PA).  <P>Use your time off to further your education or to change fields.  I'm currently trying to get back into education which is what I really went to college for anyways.  Plus having summers off for Fiero shows would just be too cool  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ken S.<BR>||||reg||1
